Chicken and Waffle ice cream is being done by a couple of folk out there, Salt & Straw and Made By Marcus have both done it but theirs and ours are very different. 

Chicken and Waffle is a very good combo, we don't have it in the UK but should as it's that good. 

So what did we do here?

Maple Syrup Ice Cream:
400g Milk (1.8-2% fat)
500g Double or Heavy Cream
30g Light Brown Sugar
150g Maple Syrup
67g SMP
1.5g Stabilizer
100g Dextrose

You will also need Liege Waffles and some chicken fat or Schmaltz. 

This has turned in to a REALLY nice ice cream combo that you MUST try if you can. 

